window.__wm001TwinMarkup="    <div class=\"sec-head\"><h2>3D Operational Twin \u2014 Ras Al Khaimah</h2><div class=\"rule\"></div><span class=\"src\">CMAP_BOUNDS \u00b7 FAC-01 \u00b7 RAQEB \u00b7 5-RAKWMA-C3-05 topo \u00b7 CesiumJS \u00b7 WGS 84 (EPSG:4326)</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"card pad\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;padding:14px 16px\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\"><h3>Engineering workspace</h3>\n        <span class=\"note\" id=\"twin-status\">loading\u2026</span></div>\n\n      <div id=\"twin-ws\">\n        <!-- left: navigation -->\n        <aside id=\"twin-left\" class=\"twin-pane\">\n          <div class=\"twin-tabs\" data-group=\"left\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"on\" data-tab=\"layers\">Layers</button><button type=\"button\" data-tab=\"civil\">Civil</button><button type=\"button\" data-tab=\"explorer\">Explorer</button><button type=\"button\" data-tab=\"index\">Indexes</button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"twin-tabbody on\" data-tab=\"layers\">\n            <div class=\"twin-k\">Discipline filter</div><div id=\"twin-disc\" class=\"twin-chips\"></div>\n            <div class=\"twin-k\">Operational layers</div><div id=\"twin-layers\"></div>\n            <div class=\"twin-k\">Sectors</div><div id=\"twin-sectors\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"twin-tabbody\" data-tab=\"civil\">\n            <div class=\"twin-k\">Regional road network \u00b7 Ras Al Khaimah and neighbours</div>\n            <div class=\"twin-row\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"twin-reg-main\">Load main roads</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"twin-reg-all\">Load with tertiary</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"twin-reg-local\">Neighbourhood roads (this view)</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"twin-reg-localall\">Neighbourhood roads (all map, by sector)</button><label class=\"twin-faint\" style=\"margin-left:6px;white-space:nowrap\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"twin-autoload\" checked> restore road layers on start</label><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"twin-aoi-here\">Set AOI here</button></div>\n            <div id=\"twin-reg-note\" class=\"twin-faint\" style=\"margin-top:4px\">map centrelines (OpenStreetMap, ODbL) for Ras Al Khaimah only (roads inside the nine sector boundaries), draped on the terrain and coloured by class; the raw response is preserved on the platform. Corridors are swept inside the AOI: point the view at a site and press Set AOI here, then Mark existing roads.</div>\n            <div class=\"twin-k\">EXIST-01 \u00b7 existing roads and buildings (OpenStreetMap on terrain)</div>\n            <div class=\"twin-row\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"twin-ex-gen\">Mark existing roads</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"twin-ex-load\">Load latest</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"twin-demo-fly\">Fly to AOI</button></div>\n            <div class=\"twin-k\">Buildings on this site</div>\n            <div class=\"twin-row\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"twin-bld-start\">Digitise building</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"twin-bld-finish\">Finish</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"twin-bld-cancel\">Cancel</button><span id=\"twin-bld-note\" class=\"twin-faint\">click the corners of a building on the imagery (3 or more), then Finish and give the name and height; stored on the platform as a digitised observation with terrain Z per corner</span></div>\n            <div class=\"twin-k\">DEMO-01 \u00b7 synthetic demonstration (proposed design, not real)</div>\n            <div class=\"twin-row\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"twin-demo-gen\">Generate synthetic</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"twin-demo-load\">Load latest synthetic</button></div>\n            <div id=\"twin-demo-note\" class=\"twin-faint\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">existing: the platform takes the real OSM centrelines and footprints inside the AOI, samples the terrain model (preserved as the terrain observation), and sweeps a cross-section assumed from the road class; widths and heights without an OSM tag are flagged as assumptions</div>\n            <div class=\"twin-k\">Layer manager (20 layers)</div>\n            <div class=\"twin-row\" style=\"margin-bottom:4px\"><label>Revision <select id=\"twin-demo-rev\"><option value=\"all\">A and B</option><option value=\"A\">A only</option><option value=\"B\">B only</option></select></label></div>\n            <div id=\"twin-lm\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"twin-tabbody\" data-tab=\"explorer\"><div id=\"twin-tree\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"twin-tabbody\" data-tab=\"index\"><div id=\"twin-index\"></div></div>\n        </aside>\n\n        <!-- centre: viewport -->\n        <div id=\"twin-centre\">\n          <div id=\"twin-toolbar\">\n            <span class=\"twin-tg\"><button type=\"button\" data-act=\"home\" title=\"Fit the nine sector boundaries\">Home</button><button type=\"button\" data-act=\"yard\" title=\"Fly to the yard: the area-of-interest centre registered on the platform (civil.aoi)\">Yard (AOI)</button><select id=\"twin-goto\" title=\"Fly to a site, the city or a sector\"><option value=\"\">Go to\u2026</option></select><button type=\"button\" data-act=\"local\" title=\"Project-local mode: orbit about the Al Jazeerah site origin\">Project-local</button><button type=\"button\" data-act=\"plan\" title=\"Plan view, orthographic, north up\">Plan</button><button type=\"button\" data-act=\"elev\" title=\"Elevation view from the south, orthographic\">Elevation</button><button type=\"button\" data-act=\"ortho\" title=\"Toggle orthographic / perspective\">Ortho</button><button type=\"button\" data-act=\"fly\" title=\"First-person: W A S D move, Q E down/up, arrows look\">Fly</button></span>\n            <span class=\"twin-tg\"><button type=\"button\" data-act=\"light\" title=\"Sun lighting on the terrain\">Lighting</button><button type=\"button\" data-act=\"shadows\" title=\"Terrain and model shadows\">Shadows</button><button type=\"button\" data-act=\"xray\" title=\"X-ray: translucent terrain and objects\">X-ray</button><button type=\"button\" data-act=\"wire\" title=\"Wireframe of the survey surface grid\">Wireframe</button><button type=\"button\" data-act=\"section\" title=\"Section box through the terrain around the Al Jazeerah site\">Section box</button><button type=\"button\" data-act=\"bld\" title=\"Load OpenStreetMap building footprints and roads within 400 m of the selected object; build 3D solids with terrain Z per corner\">Buildings (OSM)</button><button type=\"button\" data-act=\"isolate\" title=\"Isolate the selected object and its related objects\">Isolate</button><button type=\"button\" data-act=\"showall\" title=\"Reset the view: every layer on, perspective globe, section box / X-ray / wireframe / fly / orbit off, exaggeration 1.0\">Reset view</button></span>\n            <span class=\"twin-tg\"><label>Exaggeration <input type=\"range\" id=\"twin-exag\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"1\"><b id=\"twin-exag-v\">1.0\u00d7</b></label></span>\n            <span class=\"twin-tg\"><label>Revision <select id=\"twin-rev\"></select></label><button type=\"button\" data-act=\"compare\" title=\"Compare the selected surface against another registered revision\">Compare</button></span>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"twin-scene\">\n            <div id=\"twin-cesium\"></div>\n            <div id=\"twin-msg\">loading the 3D renderer\u2026</div>\n            <div id=\"twin-hud\"><span id=\"twin-coord\">lon \u2014 \u00b7 lat \u2014 \u00b7 h \u2014</span><span id=\"twin-mode\">perspective \u00b7 globe</span><span id=\"twin-tiles\" hidden></span><span id=\"twin-zoomhint\" hidden>click the map once to enable scroll zoom</span></div>\n            <div id=\"twin-fly-help\" hidden>W A S D move \u00b7 Q E down/up \u00b7 arrow keys look \u00b7 Esc exit</div>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"twin-analysis\">\n            <div class=\"twin-tabs\" data-group=\"an\">\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"on\" data-tab=\"profile\">Profile</button><button type=\"button\" data-tab=\"measure\">Measure</button><button type=\"button\" data-tab=\"qty\">Quantities</button><button type=\"button\" data-tab=\"time\">Time</button><button type=\"button\" data-tab=\"views\">Views</button><button type=\"button\" data-tab=\"cap\">Capability register</button>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"twin-tabbody on\" data-tab=\"profile\">\n              <div class=\"twin-row\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"twin-prof-pick\">Pick two points</button><label>Survey surface row <input type=\"range\" id=\"twin-prof-row\" min=\"0\" max=\"66\" value=\"33\"></label><span id=\"twin-prof-note\" class=\"twin-faint\">profile of the Al Jazeerah survey surface along a grid row, or of the terrain between two picked points</span></div>\n              <svg id=\"twin-prof\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 170\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"twin-tabbody\" data-tab=\"measure\">\n              <div class=\"twin-row\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"twin-meas-start\">Measure</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"twin-meas-clear\">Clear</button><span id=\"twin-meas-out\" class=\"twin-faint\">click points on the scene: 2 for distance and height difference, 3 or more for area</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"twin-tabbody\" data-tab=\"qty\"><div id=\"twin-qty\"></div></div>\n            <div class=\"twin-tabbody\" data-tab=\"time\">\n              <div class=\"twin-row\"><label>State at <input type=\"range\" id=\"twin-time\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"100\" style=\"width:260px\"></label><b id=\"twin-time-v\"></b><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"twin-play\">Play</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"twin-ab\">Before / after</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"twin-snap\">Save snapshot</button><span id=\"twin-time-note\" class=\"twin-faint\"></span></div>\n              <div id=\"twin-time-out\" class=\"twin-faint\" style=\"margin-top:6px\"></div>\n              <div id=\"twin-snaps\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"twin-tabbody\" data-tab=\"views\"><div class=\"twin-row\" id=\"twin-views\"></div></div>\n            <div class=\"twin-tabbody\" data-tab=\"cap\"><div id=\"twin-cap\"></div></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- right: inspection -->\n        <aside id=\"twin-right\" class=\"twin-pane\">\n          <div class=\"twin-tabs\" data-group=\"right\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"on\" data-tab=\"props\">Inspect</button><button type=\"button\" data-tab=\"lineage\">Lineage</button><button type=\"button\" data-tab=\"related\">Related</button><button type=\"button\" data-tab=\"records\">Records</button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"twin-tabbody on\" data-tab=\"props\"><div id=\"twin-props\" class=\"twin-faint\">select an object in the scene, the sector list or the explorer</div></div>\n          <div class=\"twin-tabbody\" data-tab=\"lineage\"><div id=\"twin-lineage\" class=\"twin-faint\">no object selected</div></div>\n          <div class=\"twin-tabbody\" data-tab=\"related\"><div id=\"twin-related\" class=\"twin-faint\">no object selected</div></div>\n          <div class=\"twin-tabbody\" data-tab=\"records\"><div id=\"twin-records\" class=\"twin-faint\">no object selected</div></div>\n        </aside>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"twin-base-row\">\n        <span id=\"twin-base\">base layer: loading\u2026</span>\n        <input id=\"twin-gkey\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"Google Map Tiles API key (optional)\">\n        <input id=\"twin-ion\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"Cesium ion token (optional)\">\n        <input id=\"twin-plat\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"platform URL (default http://localhost:8100)\" title=\"WM Twin platform, the system of record; leave empty for the default\">\n        <button id=\"twin-keys-apply\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn\">Apply</button>\n        <span class=\"twin-faint\">keys stay in this browser \u00b7 Google key: Photorealistic 3D Tiles \u00b7 ion token: Cesium World Terrain and OSM 3D Buildings \u00b7 without them: Esri World Imagery and Esri World Elevation</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"dirnote\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">Basis: sector polygons are CMAP_BOUNDS, the boundary data the Collection Map already uses; facility points are FAC-01;\n      cases are the RAQEB register with GPS; the Al Jazeerah survey surface is the 5-RAKWMA-C3-05 combined topo on a 10 m grid, placed by its\n      registration record (AOI centroid, rotation 0, vertical tie to the terrain model around the grid perimeter) and flagged APPROXIMATE until control\n      points are supplied. A case is assigned to a sector by point in polygon on those boundaries and the register's own sector field is kept\n      for comparison. Layers listed without verified coordinates exist in the registers with no surveyed or GPS position, so nothing is drawn\n      for them. In the published command center the imagery (Sentinel-2 cloudless) and terrain (open SRTM grid) are embedded; on the laptop the Esri layers and the WM Twin platform are used as in WM001.</p>\n    </div>";
